See plans/archive/SCHEMA_CONTRACTS_AUDIT.md Section 3b:
- execution-service/sports/models.py → internal/domain/execution-service/sports.py
- strategy-service/models/domain_data.py + order.py → internal/domain/strategy-service/
- market-data-processing-service/models.py + base_adapter.py → internal/domain/market-data-processing/
- features-onchain-service/models.py → UAC internal features.py (OnchainFeatureRecord)
- features-sports-service/schemas/output_schemas.py (column lists) → UAC internal sports.py (TypedDicts)
- unified-domain-client/schemas/instrument_key.py → UAC internal/reference/ (InstrumentKey)
